# Rust / Tauri build output (several GB) — rebuilt by build.ps1
/target/
# generated by Tauri on every build
/src-tauri/gen/

# web/wasm/wb_core.wasm is built too, but stays in the repository on purpose:
# the web version (serve.js, GitHub Pages) needs it and it is small.

# Pyodide (Python for the UNO Q's Linux side, 2.x) — about 13.5 MB, not kept in Git for now.
# Get it from npm: pyodide 314.0.8 (registry.npmjs.org/pyodide/-/pyodide-314.0.8.tgz, check the
# sha512 "integrity" npm lists) and copy pyodide.js, pyodide.mjs, pyodide.asm.mjs, pyodide.asm.wasm,
# python_stdlib.zip, pyodide-lock.json, package.json and README.md into web/vendor/pyodide/.
/web/vendor/pyodide/

# installers belong on GitHub Releases, not in the code
*.msi
*-setup.exe

